        "theme":  "Orchestration",
        "summary":  "While connecting autonomous AI agents across organizational boundaries is progressing, research shows agents frequently fail to align on shared objectives or resolve semantic differences when collaborating. Cisco\u0027s Outshift division has developed an \u0027Internet of Cognition\u0027 framework and open-source Mycelium project to address multi-agent coordination at scale. New architectural approaches are required to enable genuine collective intelligence rather than mere message passing between siloed agents.",
